  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Inclusive Infrastructure for Ethnic Minorities Project II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will upgrade and construct transport and water supply infrastructure in five districts of Phu Yen Province (PYP) and Quang Tri Province (QTP). The target districts have the highest concentration of ethnic minority communities (EMCs) in the respective provinces. The project will also enhance data systems for climate and disaster risk management in PYP, and promote inclusive socioeconomic growth for about 363,000 people, including 187,000 from EMCs.</narrative>
  </description>
