   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Climate- and disaster-resilient transport infrastructure improved 
Indicator: 133 km of district and commune roads upgraded incorporating enhanced climate resilient design that are gender responsive 
Progress/Status: On-going.
All contracts for road construction in Dak Lak province (formerly Phu Yen province) were advertised.
First works contract for road construction in Quang Tri province is to be advertised in Q1 2026. 
Data Source: PPMS and QPRs including annual road assessment from provincial road asset management database for operations and maintenance 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2024"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2027-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2027-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="133"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Climate- and disaster-resilient water resource infrastructure improved 
Indicator: At least 50,587 additional people, of whom at least 50% are women and girls, in the two project provinces are connected to potable water services 
Progress/Status: On-going.
All works contracts for water supply in Dak Lak province were advertised.
First contract for water supply in Quang Tri province is to be advertised in Q1 2026. 
Data Source: Subproject feasibility reports, detailed design reports, PPMS, QPRs, and surveys including household connections data 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="5700" year="2024"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2027-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2027-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="50587"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Climate- and disaster-resilient water resource infrastructure improved 
Indicator: Seven commercially managed rural domestic water supply schemes with capacity to supply 12,800 m3 of potable water per day constructed 
Progress/Status: On-going.
All works contracts for water supply in Dak Lak province were advertised.
First contract for water supply in Quang Tri province is to be advertised in Q1 2026. 
Data Source: PMS, QPRs, and water quality test results 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="730" year="2024"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2027-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2027-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="12800"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
