    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Data systems for climate and disaster risk management updated 
Indicator: One gender-responsive flood risk impact assessment for a pilot road network, addressing different needs and vulnerabilities of women and men, completed 
Progress/Status: TOR and cost estimate are being prepared by PMU. Advertisement for EOIs is expected in Q2 2026. 
Data Source: PPMS and QPRs 
